              "instruction": "mārukaṭṭeyalli tumbā gaddala ittu. — There was a lot of noise in the market.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *mārukaṭṭeyalli tumbā gaddala ittu.* — There was a lot of noise in the market.]"
