          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ದಿಟ್ಟಿಸು (diṭṭisu) is built on diṭṭi, \"a gaze\", usually traced to Sanskrit dṛṣṭi, \"seeing, sight\" (CDIAL 6520), through Prakrit, with the verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
