            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಬ್ಬದ ದಿನ ಬಸ್ಸುಗಳು ಜನರಿಂದ ತುಳುಕುತ್ತಿದ್ದವು. habbada dina bassugaḷu janarinda tuḷukuttiddavu. On the festival day the buses were overflowing with people."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): ತುಳುಕಿತು, tuḷukitu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Of a full pot, a crowded bus or a full heart."
            }
          ]
        },
